    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n107442" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπερεκ-πίπτω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>extend beyond, exceed,</i> c. gen., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῶν δέκα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Placit.</u>
					1.3.8
				</span></i>
			; <i>extend beyond,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				<u>UP</u>
				3.8
			</span></i>, al., <i><span class="en">
				18(1).84
			</span></i>; of time, <i><span class="en">
				<u>PThead.</u>
				10.12
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(iv A. D.)</span>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> abs., <i>go beyond all bounds,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Luc.
				<u>Herm.</u>
				67
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοσοῦτον ὑ. ὥστε</span> . .
				<i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Salt.</u>
				83
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				S.E.
				<u>M.</u>
				6.6
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>to be exceptional,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μακροβιοτείᾳ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Phld.
					<u>Sign.</u>
					17
				</span></i>
			.</div>
